    "details": "<p><strong>About:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Top three teams:</strong> Incubation opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Top three teams:</strong> PPO opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>All participants:</strong> Complimentary <code>.xyz</code> domains</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> $100 in technology credits</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> Verifiable digital certificate with a valid final submission</li>\n<li><strong>100+ reward recipients</strong> across the main hackathon, track awards, sponsor challenges, mini-challenges and giveaways</li>\n<li><strong>Hackathon starts:</strong> 20 October 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> 48 hours</li>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Completely online</li>\n<li><strong>Team size:</strong> 1&ndash;6 members</li>\n<li><strong>Registration fee:</strong> Absolutely free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>48 HOURS. ONE WORKING PRODUCT.</strong></p>\n<p>Eligible participants may also receive mentorship, technical resources, portfolio-ready product-building experience, project promotion and additional sponsor or mini-challenge rewards.</p>\n<p>A participant must complete the hackathon and make a valid final submission to receive a verifiable digital certificate. Registration alone will not qualify a participant for a certificate.</p>\n<p>Incubation, PPOs and partner benefits are subject to eligibility requirements, availability and the respective partner&rsquo;s selection process.</p>\n<p>Join the official WhatsApp group for participation details, announcements and important hackathon updates.</p>",
